{"title":"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following integers is closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e096d3cee80c65d872ef259c7df28ade0f0bb02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99 \\times 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/0/aa00598dc5cc4ea47934dde3b28e83e9e4c2a77b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10~000 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 100 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 100~000 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 1000 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"498\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/1/e915fa152bd938fd1430cb0f770910feda80973e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$891$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. This is closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/2/c420bd15ebee3569234cf625f6c0a33a1845aee1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"85\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e096d3cee80c65d872ef259c7df28ade0f0bb02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99 \\times 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> can be approximated as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/1/a016ac6ee2ff72bbca3730db5c8188b684afa86a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\times 10 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"177\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\